  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a MEMD‑QNN forecasting framework for Shenzhen Stock Exchange prices using 2267 daily samples (2013–2023). With three feature groups (technical index, Baidu search queries, and Weibo sentiment), the best model (MEMD‑QNN) achieves MAE 0.2410, RMSE 0.2996, and MAPE 0.0185, outperforming classical baselines such as BPNN, SVR, and ELM in their experiments.",
